  "descriptionModule": {
   "briefSummary": "The purpose of this study is to demonstrate the safety and effectiveness of the study drug Nebivolol, in people who suffer with high blood pressure with Chronic Obstructive Pulmonary Disease (COPD).",
   "detailedDescription": "The study would be a randomized, placebo-controlled trial of 60 hypertensive patients with documented COPD greater than age 40."
  },
